# Old Hunter Douglas dealer-site URLs → the new John Crawford Company site.
# LIVE: dist/_redirects is an exact copy of this file (see README "Domain launch").
# Netlify matches each `from` with or without a trailing slash; matching is case-sensitive, and the old site uses lowercase only.
# Specific rules come first; Netlify uses the first rule that matches.

# Apex and http addresses reach www in ONE hop (Netlify's own http->https->www chain would take two).
# Full-URL rules need the `!` (force) flag; /:splat keeps the path and any query string.
http://johncrawfordcompany.com/*       https://www.johncrawfordcompany.com/:splat   301!
https://johncrawfordcompany.com/*      https://www.johncrawfordcompany.com/:splat   301!
http://www.johncrawfordcompany.com/*   https://www.johncrawfordcompany.com/:splat   301!

# The campaign pages' old review copies on this site → the live ones on go.johncrawfordcompany.com
